OL,3,AJournalist to be crowned king in Uganda
OL,4,Aafter bitter succession dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FTooro is one of Uganda's four main
OL,7,Fofficially recognised historical
OL,8,Fkingdoms. For the last 31 years, it has
OL,9,Fbeen headed by King Oyo Nyimba Kabamba
OL,10,FIguru Rukidi IV, who was once known as
OL,11,Fa "boy king", after ascending to the
OL,12,Fthrone as an infant.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
